Argus modifications (May 2026):
- Removed Next.js framework dependencies; ported to Vite + react-router-dom
- Removed Sim's backend (Bun runtime, Drizzle ORM, BetterAuth, Trigger.dev)
- Re-wired data layer to Argus backend (PostgreSQL + Express + mcp_* schema)
- Added Argus-specific node types: SkillNode, AgentNode, ToolNode, MemoryNode,
  KnowledgeNode (bind to mcp_skills, mcp_agents, mcp_tools, mcp_agent_memory,
  mcp_rag_indexes respectively)
- Workflow execution delegated to Argus's existing src/workflows/executor.ts
- Tailwind theme adjusted to the Argus dark-first design system
- Removed Sim's multi-tenant Org→Workspace data model in favor of Argus's
  existing Teams + Bundles RBAC

Per-file copyright headers preserved where ported verbatim from Sim Studio.
